<title>USA: U.S. Q1 GDP rev to +5.8 pct from 5.6 pct.</title>
<headline>U.S. Q1 GDP rev to +5.8 pct from 5.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
